<.shell title="Card" current={:card}>
  <h1>Card</h1>
  <p class="lead">A box for one topic: on a dashboard, or the details under a result.</p>

  <div class="demo">
    <section class="card">
      <header>
        <h2 class="chart-title">D4H connection</h2>
        <span class="hint">Last refreshed today at 02:00</span>
      </header>
      <p class="paragraph">833 members, 1,912 activities.</p>
      <.button size={:sm}>
        <.icon name="hero-arrow-path-micro" /> Refresh now
      </.button>
    </section>
  </div>

  <h2>When to use</h2>
  <p>
    A dashboard with several topics, each with its own heading and maybe an action. On the verify
    pages, the details of the result under its <a href={page_path(:band)}>band</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>When not to use</h2>
  <p>To box the content of an ordinary page. Headings and space group it already.</p>

  <h2>In the app</h2>
  <p>
    <code>&lt;section class="card"&gt;</code>, with the title and a note in its <code>&lt;header&gt;</code>.
    Cards on a dashboard sit in a <code>.card-grid</code>. Inside a card,
    <code>.card-section</code>
    starts a part under a rule.
  </p>
</.shell>
